ant;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: &quot;inherit&quot;, serif;">We are thrilled to announce that our school has achieved a cent percent result in the SSC examinations this year!</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><span style="font-family: &quot;inherit&quot;, serif; font-size: 11.5pt;">This outstanding accomplishment is a testament to the hard work, </span><span style="font-family: &quot;inherit&quot;, serif; font-size: 11.5pt;">dedication, and perseverance of our students, the unwavering support of their parents, and the exceptional guidance provided by our teachers and staff. </span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: &quot;inherit&quot;, serif;"><br></span><span style="font-family: &quot;inherit&quot;, serif; font-size: 11.5pt;">Let us celebrate this milestone and continue to strive for </span><span style="font-family: &quot;inherit&quot;, serif; font-size: 11.5pt;">excellence in all our future endeavors </span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; bac